{"mode":"words","text":"Nahoře vidíš text přesně tak, jak ti ho aplikace zobrazuje. Každé slovo je malá kartička: nahoře je slovo v cílovém jazyce, pod ním jeho význam v tvém mateřském jazyce — slovo za slovem, v pořadí cílového jazyka. Pod tím je ještě jednou plynule přeložená celá věta. U jazyků s jiným písmem je přidán řádek s přepisem, abys mohl vše přečíst. Klepni na slovo: hlas pokračuje přesně od tohoto místa.","words":[{"s":0,"e":534},{"s":824,"e":1149},{"s":1231,"e":1474},{"s":1521,"e":1892},{"s":1962,"e":2415},{"s":2566,"e":2717},{"s":2775,"e":2844},{"s":2891,"e":2972},{"s":3019,"e":3471},{"s":3518,"e":4284},{"s":4911,"e":5271},{"s":5341,"e":5631},{"s":5666,"e":5724},{"s":5770,"e":6014},{"s":6084,"e":6873},{"s":7500,"e":8022},{"s":8173,"e":8290},{"s":8348,"e":8673},{"s":8696,"e":8742},{"s":8800,"e":9288},{"s":9369,"e":9985},{"s":10275,"e":10484},{"s":10530,"e":10762},{"s":10867,"e":11099},{"s":11134,"e":11656},{"s":11703,"e":11738},{"s":11819,"e":12063},{"s":12121,"e":12690},{"s":12771,"e":13224},{"s":13328,"e":13398},{"s":13584,"e":13921},{"s":13967,"e":14060},{"s":14106,"e":14652},{"s":14791,"e":14838},{"s":14907,"e":15511},{"s":15650,"e":16254},{"s":16289,"e":16869},{"s":17496,"e":17671},{"s":17705,"e":17880},{"s":17984,"e":18030},{"s":18065,"e":18332},{"s":18356,"e":18634},{"s":18692,"e":19041},{"s":19075,"e":19656},{"s":19725,"e":19981},{"s":20039,"e":20561},{"s":20956,"e":21026},{"s":21084,"e":21560},{"s":21664,"e":21699},{"s":21746,"e":21989},{"s":22059,"e":22593},{"s":22883,"e":23000},{"s":23046,"e":23464},{"s":23545,"e":24056},{"s":24207,"e":24277},{"s":24335,"e":25066},{"s":25205,"e":25449},{"s":25519,"e":25728},{"s":25751,"e":25948},{"s":25995,"e":26750},{"s":27144,"e":27481},{"s":27527,"e":27609},{"s":27655,"e":28236},{"s":28526,"e":28781},{"s":28863,"e":29431},{"s":29489,"e":29884},{"s":29965,"e":30070},{"s":30140,"e":30476},{"s":30523,"e":31301}]}